outs:
- hash: md5
  path: roadway_network.parquet
meta:
  computation:
    cmd: njdot roads fetch-network
    fetch:
      schedule: manual
    git_deps:
      /njdot/arcgis.py:
      /njdot/road_sources.py:
    note: |
      NJDOT Roadway Network (the LRS: one M-aware polyline per SRI piece, milepost on every vertex),
      from the `NJDOT_Roadway_Network/FeatureServer/0` ArcGIS service. One row per feature path with
      `x`/`y`/`m` vertex lists (EPSG:4326). The source's `editingInfo` dates are in the parquet's
      key-value metadata (`src_dataLastEditDate` …). Upstream fetch (`fetch:`, not `side_effect:`,
      so dvx still records + pushes the output): excluded from reprocs by `batch/reproc-targets`.
